pageType: content
background:
  type: image
  src: "media/template-inner.png"
  fit: {mode: cover}
elements:
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [58, 44, 820, 48]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      text: 需求三｜高并发用量分析与可重建数据链路
  - elementId: lead
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 100, 840, 30]
    content:
      style: "$subtitle"
      text: 在长时间范围和高并发访问下，同时满足查询性能、数据准确与结果可解释。
  - elementId: c1
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 158, 250, 174]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$pale"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$red"}
  - elementId: c1t
    elementType: text
    bounds: [78, 180, 214, 132]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      text: |
        <p><strong>性能要求</strong></p>
        <p>避免每次请求整批拉取与内存汇总；汇总、趋势、维度排名按 Tab 按需返回。</p>
  - elementId: c2
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [355, 158, 250, 174]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$pale"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$blue"}
  - elementId: c2t
    elementType: text
    bounds: [373, 180, 214, 132]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      text: |
        <p><strong>数据要求</strong></p>
        <p>usage_events 保留原始事实；Rollup 作为可删除、可重建的读取加速层。</p>
        <p>明细使用独立分页。</p>
  - elementId: c3
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [650, 158, 250, 174]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$pale"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$red"}
  - elementId: c3t
    elementType: text
    bounds: [668, 180, 214, 132]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      text: |
        <p><strong>解释要求</strong></p>
        <p>Rollup 未覆盖、筛选不支持或部分日期时，必须回退 raw，并返回 source / complete。</p>
        <p>禁止静默少统计。</p>
  - elementId: flow
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 380, 840, 58]
    content:
      fontSize: 20
      bold: true
      color: "$ink"
      align: [center, middle]
      text: 原始事实 → 聚合加速 → 按需查询 → 明细分页 → 来源与完整性说明
  - elementId: source
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 474, 840, 20]
    content:
      style: "$bodySmall"
      fontSize: 11
      text: 相关功能：usage_events、Hourly / Daily Rollup、维度聚合、Analytics include 与 Keyset 分页。
